  ('Ebenezer Baptist Church', 'Atlanta', 'GA', '30312', '101 Jackson St NE', 'The historic, restored sanctuary where Dr. Martin Luther King, Jr. and his father both preached and served as co-pastors.', 'https://www.getyourguide.com/sweet-auburn-l106547/walking-tours-tc3/'),
  ('Jackson Street Bridge', 'Atlanta', 'GA', '30312', '433 Freedom Park Trail', 'An iconic overpass offering a universally recognized, scenic panoramic view of the downtown Atlanta skyline, frequently visited on local photo tours.', 'https://www.getyourguide.com/sweet-auburn-l106547/walking-tours-tc3/'),
